Obsidian Equipment Reworked for Sunrise (version 1.2.0)

A port of Obsidian Equipment Reworked 1.2 by Tokimi and CozyStudios.
Original source: https://github.com/CozyCord/Obsidian-Equipment-Reworked
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Earlier ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide. Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the original's
rules are re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included), and its
content (textures, models, recipes, tags, translations) is carried over. This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (CC0-1.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.
